      "content": "i feel like i’m just a constant drain on everyone. i look at my partner and my kids and i can see how much my struggle just weighs them down. it’s like i’m a black hole sucking all the light out of the room. they’d be so much more at peace if they didn't have to constantly worry about me or deal with my mess.",
